{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is close, move to it, grab it, check its properties, perform specific task or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectClose    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
